  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Pigeon-hey Principle</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/136\">Isaac Banner</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>6</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">pass through ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">next neighbors allemande left 1½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a full hey - rights in center, lefts on ends</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles allemande right 1½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>After exhaustively searching caller’s box I’ve determined that either no one has written this one down before or Bob Isaacs did but he wants people to pay him for dances in 2023. Im sure Chris Page will tell me if this dance already exists and just isn’t searchable so I can get the actual name and “author”.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
